{"seq":1,"slug":"hook-projectile","title":"钩爪投射：让「抛出」这半个动作可信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/attachment/hook-projectile","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"钩爪投射-让-抛出-这半个动作可信\">钩爪投射：让「抛出」这半个动作可信</h1><p>玩家按下键到绳子绷紧之间，有一段常被低估的时间：钩爪在空中飞。这一小段既是「蓄势—释放」节奏的第一拍，也是玩家判断「我到底钩没钩上」的视觉线索。做得好，它给整套机制注入重量与期待；做得敷衍——比如瞬间命中、没有可见钩爪——机制会「对但没味」。这一篇只讲钩爪本体如何飞出、飞多快、脱靶怎么办；通用弹道模型不在这里重复，去 <a href=\"../../game-projectile-ballistics/foundations/hitscan-vs-projectile\">72_game-projectile-ballistics</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-瞬发命中还是实体投射\">核心概念：瞬发命中还是实体投射</h2><p>第一个、也是最影响手感的决策：钩爪是<strong>瞬发命中</strong>（hitscan，按下即判定终点，钩爪只是事后补的视觉）还是<strong>实体投射</strong>（projectile，钩爪是一个真在空中移动、逐帧检测命中的实体）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[按下发射] --&gt; B{钩爪类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|Hitscan| C[立即射线判定终点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[反向绘制钩爪飞行动画&lt;br/&gt;纯视觉,不影响判定]&#10;  D --&gt; E[到达即 Attached]&#10;  B --&gt;|Projectile| F[生成钩爪实体]&#10;  F --&gt; G[每物理帧推进位置]&#10;  G --&gt; H{逐帧命中检测}&#10;  H --&gt;|命中| E&#10;  H --&gt;|超程/脱靶| I[Retracting 收回]\">graph TD\n  A[按下发射] --&gt; B{钩爪类型}\n  B --&gt;|Hitscan| C[立即射线判定终点]\n  C --&gt; D[反向绘制钩爪飞行动画&lt;br/&gt;纯视觉,不影响判定]\n  D --&gt; E[到达即 Attached]\n  B --&gt;|Projectile| F[生成钩爪实体]\n  F --&gt; G[每物理帧推进位置]\n  G --&gt; H{逐帧命中检测}\n  H --&gt;|命中| E\n  H --&gt;|超程/脱靶| I[Retracting 收回]</pre><p>两者的差别不只是实现，而是玩法契约：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>瞬发命中 hitscan</th>\n<th>实体投射 projectile</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判定时机</td>\n<td>按下即定终点</td>\n<td>钩爪飞到才定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓄势感</td>\n<td>弱（结果已定，动画是补的）</td>\n<td>强（飞行中有悬念）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可被躲避</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（对动目标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可被格挡/打断</td>\n<td>难</td>\n<td>易（拦截飞行中的钩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络对齐</td>\n<td>简单（一次判定）</td>\n<td>复杂（需同步飞行体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合原型</td>\n<td>定点瞬拉、刚性拖拽</td>\n<td>自由摆荡、拉物近身、对战</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：<strong>单人、强调干脆位移</strong>的抓钩（《只狼》）多用 hitscan，反正结果确定、玩家要的是果断；<strong>强调节奏与空间博弈、或有 PvP</strong> 的抓钩多用 projectile，因为「钩能不能钩到动着的目标」本身就是玩法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"飞行速度与到达时间\">飞行速度与到达时间</h2><p>即便选 projectile，飞行速度也不能照抄真实。真实抓钩枪的绳速可能几十米每秒，但游戏里如果钩爪飞太慢，玩家会觉得黏；飞太快，蓄势的一拍又消失。实践中常把飞行时间锁定在一个<strong>固定的目标区间</strong>，而不是固定速度——无论近钩远钩，到达时间都落在比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间，超远距离才允许更久。</p>\n<p>用固定到达时间反推速度：设锚点距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、期望到达时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则钩爪速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = d / t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，但对速度做上下限裁剪：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">clamp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\operatorname{clamp}\\left(\\frac{d}{t_{\\text{target}}},\\; v_{\\min},\\; v_{\\max}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样近距离不会「啪」一下太快失去手感，远距离也不会慢到玩家等得不耐烦。到达时间是手感的一部分，具体窗口靠调，方法见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-feel\">4_practice/1_grapple-feel.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直线-弧线还是可控曲线\">直线、弧线还是可控曲线</h2><p>大多数抓钩的钩爪走<strong>直线</strong>——瞄哪飞哪，简单且可预测，适合作为移动工具。但有些设计让钩爪走<strong>弧线</strong>或<strong>可微引导</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直线：<code>hookPos += aimDir * v * dt</code>，命中检测沿这条线做。最常见，玩家心智模型最清晰。</li>\n<li>重力弧线：钩爪受一点重力，走抛物线。观感更「有重量」，但让瞄准变难，通常只在特定风格（投掷式钩爪）里用。抛物线运动学与通用弹道同源，见 <a href=\"../../game-projectile-ballistics/motion/ballistic-trajectory\">72_game-projectile-ballistics</a>。</li>\n<li>轻度追踪（homing）：飞行中向最近合法点微微弯曲，本质是把「瞄准辅助」前置到钩爪上。这会模糊「玩家意图」，用不好会让玩家觉得「钩自己乱飞」，一般只给很小的修正角。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发射方向 aimDir] --&gt; B[直线: 可预测,移动工具首选]&#10;  A --&gt; C[重力弧线: 有重量,瞄准变难]&#10;  A --&gt; D[轻度追踪: 命中率高,可能夺走掌控感]\">graph TD\n  A[发射方向 aimDir] --&gt; B[直线: 可预测,移动工具首选]\n  A --&gt; C[重力弧线: 有重量,瞄准变难]\n  A --&gt; D[轻度追踪: 命中率高,可能夺走掌控感]</pre><p>选择上，把「钩爪弧线」和「附着吸附」分开考虑：如果你想提高命中率，优先在附着点做吸附（见 <a href=\"valid-surfaces\">3_valid-surfaces.md</a>）而不是让钩爪追踪，因为前者对玩家更透明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"脱靶与回收-不能被忽略的另一半\">脱靶与回收：不能被忽略的另一半</h2><p><code>Traveling</code> 状态有两个出口，命中之外的那个——脱靶——最常被草草处理。钩爪飞出去没打中任何合法面时，必须有一个明确、有反馈的回收过程，否则玩家会陷入「钩还没回来、也不知道能不能再按」的悬置。</p>\n<p>处理脱靶的三个要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>超程判定</strong>：给钩爪一个最大射程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。飞行累计距离超过它就停止前进、转入 <code>Retracting</code>。这也防止 projectile 无限飞。</li>\n<li><strong>可见回收</strong>：钩爪不是瞬间消失，而是以更快速度收回手中，播放收线动画。这段时间玩家通常应被禁止再次发射（或允许打断以提高响应，取决于手感取向）。</li>\n<li><strong>失败反馈</strong>：一声「叮——空」的音效、准星短暂变红，明确告诉玩家「这次没钩上」。缺了这个，玩家会把「脱靶」误读成「机制卡了」。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>脱靶后能否立即重钩，是响应性与「不能连发骚扰」之间的权衡，属于手感范畴，详见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-feel\">4_practice/1_grapple-feel.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>瞬发命中 vs 实体投射</strong>是首要决策：前者干脆、网络简单、适合单人位移；后者有悬念、可被躲被打断、适合节奏博弈与 PvP。</li>\n<li>飞行速度最好锁<strong>固定到达时间区间</strong>再反推、并做上下限裁剪，而非固定速度——保证近远钩手感一致。</li>\n<li>钩爪轨迹优先用<strong>直线</strong>（心智模型最清晰）；提高命中率优先在附着点做吸附，而非让钩爪追踪，以免夺走掌控感。</li>\n<li><strong>脱靶回收</strong>是 <code>Traveling</code> 不可省的另一半：需要超程判定、可见回收、明确失败反馈，否则玩家会误以为机制卡死。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"attach-detection\">附着点检测</a>——钩爪命中后如何判定与对齐。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/grapple-model\">抓钩状态模型</a>——本篇填充的是 Firing/Traveling/Retracting 状态。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-projectile-ballistics/foundations/hitscan-vs-projectile\">弹道 · 命中扫描与投射对比</a>——通用弹道视角的同一决策。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-projectile-ballistics/motion/ballistic-trajectory\">弹道 · 弹道轨迹</a>——重力弧线钩爪的运动学。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：hitscan/projectile 权衡与飞行时间做法综合自 Kodeco Unity 抓钩教程（kodeco.com）、Unity Discussions 关于 raycast 最大射程的讨论（discussions.unity.com）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"钩爪投射：让「抛出」这半个动作可信","id":"钩爪投射-让-抛出-这半个动作可信"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：瞬发命中还是实体投射","id":"核心概念-瞬发命中还是实体投射"},{"level":2,"text":"飞行速度与到达时间","id":"飞行速度与到达时间"},{"level":2,"text":"直线、弧线还是可控曲线","id":"直线-弧线还是可控曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"脱靶与回收：不能被忽略的另一半","id":"脱靶与回收-不能被忽略的另一半"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"抓钩状态模型：一套装下所有原型的生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/foundations/grapple-model"},"next":{"title":"附着点检测：命中判定的精度、延迟与一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/attachment/attach-detection"}}